{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21994","headline":"续古诗十首 十 · 白居易","name":"续古诗十首 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春旦日初出，曈曈耀晨辉。\n草木照未远，浮云已蔽之。\n天地黯以晦，当午如昏时。\n虽有东南风，力微不能吹。\n中园何所有，满地青青葵。\n阳光委云上，倾心欲何依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21994.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21994","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}